    "content" : "Remark 3. According to Remark 2, each Iij can be written as an interval Iij = [Lij,Uij] where Lij and Uij are the lower and upper bounds of the interval, respectively. Also, each Sij (if it is non-empty) is obtained as one of the forms of Sij = {Lij}, Sij = {Uij}, Sij = {Lij,Uij} or Sij = [Lij,Uij]."
  }, {
